 Header Metadata:
 Form Number: (DHA-1739) Form 10  
 Document Title: APPLICATION FOR RENEWAL OF EXISTING VISA  
 Issuing Authority: Department of Home Affairs, Republic of South Africa  
 Legal Basis: Section 10(7); Regulation 9(9)  
 Gazette Reference: Government Gazette, 22 May 2014, No. 37679, pp. 117–127  
 For Official Use Only Section:
 Office of application, Date received, Submission quality checked by, Track & Trace Ref No, BLOK, File No  
 Date forwarded to Head Office, Date received at Head Office, Passport checked and returned by, Decision, Persal number, Date, Receipt no for fee paid, Remarks  
 Conditions of visa / reason(s) for refusal text field  
 Important Submission Instruction:
 Mandatory rule: Application for renewal must be submitted in person at least 60 days prior to the expiry date of the existing visa.  
 Particulars of Applicant:
 Surname/Family name & First name(s)  
 Residential address in the Republic  
 Date of birth  
 Telephone No., Home Telephone No., Cellphone No., E-mail address  
 Passport Details:
 Passport number, Issuing country, Date of issue, Valid until  
 Other government identity document details (Type of document, Number, Date of issue, Expiry date)  
 Original & Subsequent Visa Details:
 Original Visa (Prior to/on arrival): Date of entry, Place of entry, Visa No, Purpose of entry, Type of visa, Date of expiry  
 Subsequent Visa / Recent Renewal: Type of visa, Date of issue/renewal, Issued at, Date of expiry  
 Extension Request: Required until date & Reason(s) for request  
 Declaration by Applicant:
 Solemn declaration of truth and correctness  
 Signature of applicant, Location signed at, Date (day, month, year)  
 Supporting Document Checklists by Visa Type:
 Port of Entry Visa Renewal: Passport valid ≥30 days past intended departure, proof of financial means, return ticket/reservation, event organization letter (if applicable).  
 Visitor's Visa (≤ 3 Months): Passport valid ≥30 days past intended departure, statement of purpose/duration, return ticket/reservation, proof of financial means.  
 Visitor's Visa (> 3 Months):
 General: Passport valid ≥30 days past intended departure, medical report, radiological report, flight ticket/reservation, proof of financial means, SA Police Clearance (if resident ≥12 months).  
 Category-specific additions: Spouse/dependent child of visa holder (certified copy of visa + financial undertaking), international school teacher (employment contract + financial undertaking), film/ad production (production confirmation), foreign news journalist (secondment confirmation), visiting professor/lecturer (invitation letter), artists (portfolio), entertainment industry (host confirmation), tour leader (contract + financial undertaking), state witness (request signed by Deputy Director of Public Prosecutions).  
 Study Visa Renewal: Official letter from Registrar/Principal confirming extension, Registrar undertakings (notify failure to register within 7 days, deregistration within 30 days, completion within 30 days), minor guardian details & parental consent (if applicable), foreign state financial undertaking (if applicable), registered medical scheme proof/undertaking, proof of financial means.  
 Treaty Visa Renewal: Letter from organ of state attesting to program details, written undertaking by state organ accepting deportation costs.  
 Business Visa Renewal: SAICA/SAIPA Chartered Accountant certificate (original investment retained, Department of Labour confirmation of 60% SA staff), SARS tax clearance certificate, UIF contribution proof, COIDA contribution proof, CIPC registration proof, SAQA professional body registration, DTI recommendation letter, previous year financial statements, 60% SA staff confirmation letter.  
 Medical Treatment Visa Renewal: SA medical practitioner/institution letter (space availability, estimated costs, treatment schedule), confirmation/details of party responsible for medical expenses, details of accompanying persons, return flight ticket, proof of financial means.  
 Relative's Visa Renewal: Proof of 2nd-degree kinship (unabridged birth certificate), gazetted monthly financial assurance (salary advice/certified bank statement ≤3 months old, except for dependent child), police clearance.  
 General Work Visa Renewal: Employer deportation cost undertaking, employer passport validity undertaking, Department of Labour certificate (labour standards, contract, CIPC details), employer notification undertaking (non-compliance/termination/role change), SAQA professional body registration proof.  
 Critical Skills Work Visa Renewal: Employer deportation cost undertaking, employer passport validity undertaking, copy of existing critical skills visa, SAQA professional body registration proof.  
 Retired Person Visa Renewal: Proof of payment from pension/annuity/net worth/assets realizing minimum gazetted monthly amount.
